  "G2_rule19_collision": "ercot_ordc_total_reserve=True AND energy_reserve_coopt=True are ARMED on the keeper: the LP enforces the published ORDC total-reserve demand curve and its dual IS the model's RTORPA. A published-RTORPA overlay would be a SECOND mechanism for the same phenomenon, stacked on the first's unexplained residual -- rule 19 [R-ONE-MECH] verbatim.",
